This product bundles Xiph.Org Foundation software, vendored under
ios/Vendor/ and used to decode Ogg Vorbis, which Apple's Core Audio does not
support:

  libogg 1.3.5    — ios/Vendor/ogg,    see ios/Vendor/ogg/COPYING
  libvorbis 1.3.7 — ios/Vendor/vorbis, see ios/Vendor/vorbis/COPYING

Both are Copyright (c) 2002-2020 Xiph.org Foundation and are licensed under
the 3-clause BSD licence, reproduced in the COPYING files above.

The sources are unmodified. Only a subset is included: the decoder, plus the
encoder, which the test suite uses to generate a real Vorbis bitstream rather
than depending on an external tool. Xiph's own build system files and the
standalone tools carrying their own main() are omitted.
